{
  "_note": "Names only. No values. 2026-11-19 Secret (issue #18486): Doppler project revvel-standards config prd is the source. priority_projects are CircleCI slugs. linear-a is gh/midnghtsapphire/linear-a. Context ai-review-llm gets the LLM and Notion read names. Context ai-review-post gets ADMIN_GITHUB_TOKEN only.",
